         gir1.2-soup-3.0,
         gir1.2-secret-1,
         default-dbus-session-bus | dbus-session-bus,
         gnome-keyring
Description: GNOME Shell indicator for Codex, Claude Code and OpenCode Go usage
 Shows Codex (ChatGPT), Claude Code and OpenCode Go quota in the GNOME top
 bar: two stacked windows, reset times and a detailed quota dropdown.
 .
 The extension reads the OAuth tokens stored by the codex and claude
 command-line tools. OpenCode Go uses a user-configured API key saved in the
 desktop Secret Service keyring. No extension-owned background service is
 needed. It is not affiliated with OpenAI, Anthropic or OpenCode.
